WEBVTT

00:08:28.378 --> 00:08:30.032
without fearing

00:08:30.056 --> 00:08:31.568
or being embarrassed

00:08:31.592 --> 00:08:33.463
or harassment.

00:08:34.044 --> 00:08:37.146
We began to introduce everyone

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:42.493
to films that opened up their minds
to competing worldviews,

00:08:42.517 --> 00:08:45.327
encouraging children
to build critical thinking

00:08:45.351 --> 00:08:47.272
so that they could ask questions.

00:08:47.968 --> 00:08:51.285
And we expanded our scope
beyond honor killings,

00:08:51.309 --> 00:08:54.206
talking about income inequality,

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:55.847
the environment,

00:08:55.871 --> 00:09:00.040
talking about ethnic relations,
religious tolerance and compassion.